# Built binaries: a demo is source, and a committed binary never comes out of the history.
*.exe
/**/demo
/**/bin/

# Generated log files never belong here. LogLens measures on files from 1 MB to 50 GB,
# and fifty gigabytes in git cannot be taken out again -- what is once in the history
# stays there, and a clone would be useless forever. wzlrun already refuses a directory
# inside the repository; this is the net underneath that.
*.log
*.jsonl
/**/logs/

# built calculator binaries
calculator/bin/
